id: assault-buddy
name: Assault Buddy
kind: gear
itemType: buddy
buddyEffect: activated
maneuverType: standard
actionCost: 1
buddyAction: assault
chooses: profile
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Active, for an Action: an attack of the Profile assigned to it, its Damage Attribute your
  Buddy Attribute. Adventuring: Force and Magic Modifiers 1(bT) higher.
text: >
  Assault Buddy: This little helper is able to assist you in battle.
  –Buddy Effect Type: Active
  –Maneuver Type: Standard Maneuver
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Effects: Upon gaining this Buddy, assign a Profile to this Buddy. When you use this Buddy
  Effect, make an Attacking Maneuver of the assigned Profile. The Damage Attribute for this
  Attacking Maneuver is your Buddy Attribute.
  –Adventure Effect: This Buddy increases your Force and Magic Modifiers by 1(bT) while
  Adventuring.

---

# --- What the system does ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Its Profile - any, with its Foundation - is chosen when it is given. Use, on its row, once a
# Combat Round while it is Active: an attack of that Profile for an Action, declared as any is.
# It is the owner's attack: their Strike, their Ki for its cost, and it counts towards
# Diminishing Offense. Its Damage Attribute is the Buddy Attribute - 8 at base Tier 1, and 3 more
# for each base Tier after.

[passive]
if (adventuring) {
  force.mod += 1(bT);
  magic.mod += 1(bT);
}
